  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEFMES IV - Support to the Spanish Authorities in the Management of the Migratory Flows to Spain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support the Spanish Ministry of the Interior, in the management of irregular migratory flows to Spain by providing guidance and information to migrants who have arrived irregularly to the Spanish coasts and lack information about their administrative status and its legal implications. The actions will be carried out by a team of cultural mediators based on the points of entry at the Island of Gran Canaria, Almeria and Malaga, with ad-hoc visits to other landing/entry points in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
